# Every committed blob in this repo is LF. Without this, a checkout on a
# machine where some editor or copy step rewrites files to CRLF makes git
# report every source file as modified, which buries real edits in whitespace
# churn (this happened 2026-07-29: 12 "modified" files, zero real changes).
# `text=auto eol=lf` normalizes on commit AND checks out LF everywhere,
# regardless of each machine's core.autocrlf.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary — never touch the bytes.
*.png binary
